# Measured facts and packaged artifacts. Regenerated by CI; a release is recorded by its
# GitHub Release assets, not by files committed back to the branch.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash. Unanchored, `release/` also matches `scripts/release/`,
# which silently dropped the release tooling from the repository — everything still passed
# locally, and the runner had no such files.
